      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>one of the hardest parts is just the silence. like, it's not just that he's not here, it's that the person i was when i was with him doesn't exist anymore. i try to think about what i'd do if i was just \"me\" and i can't even grasp it. it feels like there's nothing left to even bother with. why does it feel like so much effort just to exist when there's nothing to exist for?",
